      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lewisburg%2C_Ohio",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 1833 Lewisburg had one Lutheran church, four stores, two taverns, two physicians, a botanical practitioner, two merchant mills, forty houses, and about 200 residents.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
